        "ai_gen_block_d149a36_m7Caxe": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_d149a36",
          "name": "Refund policy content",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "",
            "policy_content": "<h2>Who We Work With<br/></h2><p>GKU works with businesses across the automotive, consumer electronics, retail, fleet, and corporate sectors.</p><h3>-Distributors & Importers</h3><p>Bring GKU dash cams to your local market through regional distribution and long-term business partnerships. We welcome qualified partners with established sales channels and market experience.</p><h3>-Online & Offline Retailers</h3><p>Add GKU dash cams and accessories to your e-commerce store, electronics retail business, automotive shop, or other retail channels.</p><h3>-Fleet & Commercial Operators</h3><p>Explore reliable dash cam solutions for company vehicles, delivery fleets, taxis, rideshare vehicles, commercial transportation, and other professional driving applications.</p><h3>-Corporate & Bulk Buyers</h3><p>Purchase GKU products in volume for employee rewards, corporate gifting, promotional programs, company vehicles, and other organizational needs.</p><h3>-Automotive Dealers & Installers</h3><p>Expand your automotive services with GKU dash cams, hardwire kits, mounts, rear cameras, and other installation accessories.</p><h3>-OEM & Custom Projects</h3><p>Discuss selected customization opportunities for products, packaging, branding, accessories, and project-specific requirements.</p><h2>Why Partner with GKU?</h2><h3>-Comprehensive Dash Cam Portfolio</h3><p>Access a growing range of 4K, front and rear, multi-channel, 4G-connected, and smart dash cam solutions designed for different customers and driving scenarios.</p><h3>-Flexible Wholesale Solutions</h3><p>Wholesale pricing and order quantities can be tailored according to product, purchasing volume, destination, market, and partnership requirements.</p><h3>-Global Business Support</h3><p>Work directly with the GKU team on product selection, order planning, logistics, marketing resources, and long-term business opportunities.</p><h3>-Marketing & Sales Resources</h3><p>Eligible partners can access product images, specifications, videos, promotional materials, and other resources to support local marketing and sales.</p><h3>-Customization Opportunities</h3><p>Selected projects may support customized packaging, branding, product configurations, accessories, inserts, and other requirements depending on project scope and order quantity.</p><h3>-Long-Term Partnership</h3><p>GKU welcomes lasting relationships with distributors, retailers, fleet operators, automotive businesses, and corporate customers looking to grow together.</p><h2>Dash Cam Solutions for Different Business Needs</h2><p>Different businesses require different vehicle camera solutions. GKU offers a flexible product portfolio for a wide range of commercial applications.</p><h3>-Retail & E-Commerce</h3><p>Offer customers GKU dash cams and accessories across online stores, consumer electronics channels, automotive retailers, and marketplaces.</p><p><strong>Recommended Solutions:</strong> 4K Dash Cams · Front & Rear Dash Cams · Dash Cam Accessories</p><h3>-Fleet & Commercial Vehicles</h3><p>Improve vehicle visibility and maintain reliable driving records with dash cam solutions designed for company and commercial vehicles.</p><p><strong>Recommended Solutions:</strong> Front & Rear Dash Cams · Multi-Channel Dash Cams · 4G Dash Cams</p><h3>-Taxi & Rideshare</h3><p>Capture the road, cabin, and rear of the vehicle with multi-channel dash cam systems suitable for taxis, rideshare drivers, and professional drivers.</p><p><strong>Recommended Solutions:</strong> 3-Channel Dash Cams · Front & Cabin Recording</p><h3>-Remote Vehicle Monitoring</h3><p>Explore connected dash cam solutions designed to support remote monitoring and enhanced vehicle protection.</p><p><strong>Recommended Solutions:</strong> 4G LTE Dash Cams · Parking Protection · GPS</p><h3>-Corporate Gifting</h3><p>Choose practical automotive technology for employee rewards, corporate gifting, promotional campaigns, and customer appreciation programs.</p><p><strong>Available Options:</strong> Bulk Purchasing · Customized Packaging · Branding Options</p><h3>-Automotive Dealers & Installers</h3><p>Add dash cams and installation accessories to your automotive product and service portfolio.</p><p><strong>Recommended Solutions:</strong> Dash Cams · Hardwire Kits · Mounts · Rear Cameras · Memory Cards</p><h2>Corporate Gifting & Bulk Orders</h2><h3>Make GKU Part of Your Next Corporate Program</h3><p>Looking for dash cams for employee rewards, corporate gifting, promotional programs, customer incentives, or large-volume purchases?</p><p>GKU supports selected corporate and bulk-order projects with volume pricing and customization options.</p><p>Depending on order quantity and project requirements, available services may include:</p><ul><li>Customized packaging</li><li>Company logo applications</li><li>Custom labels or stickers</li><li>Gift cards and inserts</li><li>Product bundles</li><li>Selected packaging modifications</li><li>Bulk shipping arrangements</li></ul><p>Tell us your estimated quantity, destination, required delivery date, and customization needs, and our business team will help prepare a solution for your project.</p><h2>Wholesale & Distribution Opportunities</h2><h2>-Grow Your Market with GKU</h2><p>GKU welcomes qualified distributors, importers, retailers, and automotive partners interested in developing long-term business relationships.</p><p>Distribution opportunities may vary by country, region, product category, and existing market coverage.</p><p>When contacting us about a distribution partnership, please provide information about:</p><ul><li>Your company</li><li>Country or target market</li><li>Current sales channels</li><li>Automotive or electronics industry experience</li><li>Estimated purchasing volume</li><li>Products of interest</li><li>Online and offline distribution capabilities</li></ul><p>Our business team will review your information and discuss available partnership opportunities.</p><p><strong>Apply to Become a GKU Distributor</strong></p><h2>How to Start a GKU Business Partnership</h2><h3>1. Tell Us About Your Business</h3><p>Share your company information, market, sales channels, target products, estimated order quantity, and business requirements.</p><h3>2. Receive a Business Proposal</h3><p>Our team will review your requirements and discuss applicable pricing, minimum order quantities, product availability, customization options, and shipping arrangements.</p><h3>3. Confirm Your Order</h3><p>Finalize your products, quantities, pricing, payment terms, packaging requirements, and delivery arrangements.</p><h3>4. Grow with GKU</h3><p>Eligible long-term partners can receive ongoing product, marketing, sales, and business support as the partnership develops.</p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
